{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "start",
      "type": "start",
      "position": {"x": 50, "y": 100},
      "data": {"label": "开始"}
    },
    {
      "id": "think-1",
      "data": {
        "label": "需求分析",
        "prompt": "请分析用户的旅行需求，提取以下信息并以JSON格式输出：\n{ \"destination\": \"目的地城市\", \"from_city\": \"出发城市\", \"checkin\": \"入住日期YYYY-MM-DD\", \"checkout\": \"退房日期YYYY-MM-DD\", \"travel_date\": \"出发日期YYYY-MM-DD\", \"guests\": 2, \"days\": 3, \"summary\": \"需求概要\" }\n注意：如果日期不确定，可以使用今天之后3天的日期作为默认日期。",
        "stream": false,
        "modelId": 1,
        "maxTokens": 1024,
        "outputVar": "analysis",
        "description": "分析用户需求并提取旅行参数",
        "temperature": 0.3
      },
      "type": "llm",
      "position": {"x": 138, "y": 84}
    },
    {
      "id": "set_tool_params",
      "type": "variable_assigner",
      "position": {"x": 350, "y": 84},
      "data": {
        "label": "设置工具参数",
        "description": "从分析结果中提取参数供工具使用",
        "params": {
          "from_city": "北京",
          "to_city": "{{analysis.destination}}",
          "date": "{{analysis.travel_date}}",
          "city": "{{analysis.destination}}",
          "checkin": "{{analysis.checkin}}",
          "checkout": "{{analysis.checkout}}",
          "guests": 2,
          "days": 3
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "act-1",
      "data": {
        "label": "查询航班",
        "tool_name": "flight_query",
        "params": {
          "from_city": "北京",
          "to_city": "{{analysis.destination}}",
          "date": "{{analysis.travel_date}}",
          "passengers": 2,
          "travel_class": "economy"
        },
        "description": "查询可用航班信息"
      },
      "type": "tool",
      "position": {"x": 437, "y": 47}
    },
    {
      "id": "act-2",
      "data": {
        "label": "查询酒店",
        "tool_name": "hotel_query",
        "params": {
          "city": "{{analysis.destination}}",
          "checkin": "{{analysis.checkin}}",
          "checkout": "{{analysis.checkout}}",
          "guests": 2,
          "price_range": [200, 2000],
          "rating": 4.0
        },
        "description": "查询目的地酒店信息"
      },
      "type": "tool",
      "position": {"x": 430, "y": 140}
    },
    {
      "id": "act-3",
      "data": {
        "label": "查询天气",
        "tool_name": "weather_query",
        "params": {
          "city": "{{analysis.destination}}",
          "days": 7
        },
        "description": "查询目的地天气预报"
      },
      "type": "tool",
      "position": {"x": 418, "y": 227}
    },
    {
      "id": "observe-1",
      "data": {
        "label": "方案评估",
        "prompt": "请整合以下信息：\n1. 航班信息：{{flight_query}}\n2. 酒店信息：{{hotel_query}}\n3. 天气信息：{{weather_query}}\n\n请评估这些信息是否足够，或者是否需要进一步查询？请用JSON格式输出：\n{\n  \"needs_more\": false,\n  \"needs_reason\": \"\",\n  \"summary\": \"完整的旅行方案概要\"\n}",
        "stream": false,
        "modelId": 1,
        "maxTokens": 1024,
        "outputVar": "evaluation",
        "description": "整合信息并评估是否足够",
        "temperature": 0.3
      },
      "type": "llm",
      "position": {"x": 725, "y": 205}
    },
    {
      "id": "decision-1",
      "data": {
        "label": "是否需要更多查询",
        "condition": "{{evaluation.needs_more}} == true",
        "description": "判断是否需要进一步查询"
      },
      "type": "condition",
      "position": {"x": 68, "y": 348}
    },
    {
      "id": "final-1",
      "data": {
        "label": "生成方案",
        "prompt": "请根据以下信息，为用户生成完整的旅行方案：\n用户需求：{{analysis}}\n航班信息：{{flight_query}}\n酒店信息：{{hotel_query}}\n天气信息：{{weather_query}}\n\n方案应包括：\n1. 航班推荐\n2. 酒店推荐\n3. 每日行程建议\n4. 天气提示\n5. 预算估算\n\n请用友好的格式输出，易于阅读。",
        "stream": false,
        "modelId": 1,
        "maxTokens": 2048,
        "outputVar": "final_plan",
        "description": "生成最终旅行方案",
        "temperature": 0.7
      },
      "type": "llm",
      "position": {"x": 367, "y": 313}
    },
    {
      "id": "output",
      "type": "output",
      "position": {"x": 367, "y": 400},
      "data": {
        "label": "输出结果",
        "outputVar": "final_plan"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "end",
      "type": "end",
      "position": {"x": 367, "y": 450},
      "data": {"label": "结束"}
    }
  ],
